WEBVTT

00:17.240 --> 00:18.870
Akashi-kun...

00:32.720 --> 00:41.060
The ink on today's graffiti runs

00:41.060 --> 00:52.070
A bicycle that has been abandoned awaits someone's return

00:52.070 --> 01:03.040
When we realized, it was up for us to choose if our existence is a replica or not

01:03.040 --> 01:07.420
Where is our proof?

01:07.420 --> 01:12.510
It's mankinds nature to come together

01:12.510 --> 01:17.550
Our love and bonds are things we can trust

01:17.550 --> 01:22.350
My sins are to be doubted

01:22.350 --> 01:28.690
The light I saw when you first held out your right hand

01:32.070 --> 01:37.530
We really are

01:46.040 --> 01:48.250
The Dark Metal

01:53.500 --> 01:56.970
Episode 23
Proof of the Strongest

02:00.260 --> 02:01.470
It's coming!

02:01.470 --> 02:03.680
The Sable has made contact with the Corpse!

02:03.970 --> 02:05.770
Are you all right, Mahmu?

02:05.770 --> 02:07.230
It's huge!

02:07.230 --> 02:09.060
It's really huge!

02:09.650 --> 02:11.060
It's growing even bigger?

02:11.060 --> 02:12.820
This is an image from the Sable.

02:13.650 --> 02:16.570
It's roughly 1.8 times bigger!

02:17.030 --> 02:18.530
It's getting faster somehow.

02:18.530 --> 02:19.490
No...

02:19.490 --> 02:20.570
It's catching up!

02:21.490 --> 02:21.820
Mahmu!

02:29.080 --> 02:31.710
The Sable has retreated for now.

02:32.000 --> 02:34.460
We'll switch to plan B.

02:34.880 --> 02:36.840
All units, depart standby point.

02:36.840 --> 02:39.090
Join the Sable and attack the Corpse!

02:39.090 --> 02:39.930
Roger!

02:41.220 --> 02:41.970
Akashi?

02:42.550 --> 02:43.470
Is something wrong?

02:44.140 --> 02:44.890
No...

02:45.640 --> 02:48.310
It's just that Heito is still...

02:49.770 --> 02:51.810
Don't overdo it, Akashi.

02:51.810 --> 02:54.520
I'll fight in your place.

02:54.520 --> 02:56.860
Are you able to link with me?

02:56.860 --> 03:00.030
What's with the enthusiastic comment?

03:00.030 --> 03:04.410
I'm saying I'm going to become the Reaper.

03:04.410 --> 03:05.990
Link with you?

03:05.990 --> 03:07.370
How repulsing.

03:08.790 --> 03:11.250
The resonance rate is even higher...

03:11.250 --> 03:13.040
What do you mean?

03:13.040 --> 03:17.340
We had recognized that Heito
was born with a high resonance.

03:17.670 --> 03:22.390
Turning to Necrometal might've raised it to LIM levels.

03:22.390 --> 03:26.260
But this resonance pattern isn't a LIM's...

03:28.930 --> 03:33.730
All his life he's been rather sensitive about how other people feel.

03:33.230 --> 03:38.530
And at some point, he closed his heart off and started to reject pretty much everyone.

03:39.490 --> 03:40.740
I see...

03:40.740 --> 03:46.410
Akashi's innate resonance was
already past the theoretical limit.

03:46.410 --> 03:49.580
If that's the case, how he encroached into the LIM and went wild...

03:50.540 --> 03:54.750
The impossibly high resonance with Aoshi and this thing with Heito...

03:54.750 --> 03:56.340
It all makes sense!

03:57.040 --> 03:59.760
Heito didn't appear in front of Akashi.

03:59.760 --> 04:02.510
Akashi is the one drawing Heito in!

04:03.680 --> 04:04.720
I am?

04:05.430 --> 04:08.180
The resonance you sealed away since your childhood...

04:08.850 --> 04:13.310
It's strengthening to something
comparable to LIMs based on your experiences.

04:15.100 --> 04:19.610
MA-Vesses have receptor modules to receive the LIM's will.

04:19.610 --> 04:25.360
If you can unleash your power, you should be able to become one with the Argent without a LIM!

04:34.250 --> 04:35.460
Akashi-kun!

04:36.330 --> 04:37.380
Pathetic.

04:37.380 --> 04:37.960
Shut up!

04:42.550 --> 04:44.430
Come on, over here!

04:45.890 --> 04:48.390
Man, this thing really is huge.

04:58.860 --> 05:01.730
Are you unable to unleash its power, Akashi-kun?

05:02.030 --> 05:03.110
Mahmu!

05:03.110 --> 05:06.110
I'll draw its attention, so get behind it!

05:06.110 --> 05:06.910
O-Okay!

05:08.450 --> 05:12.370
I'll become your LIM and kill everyone in this world for you.

05:13.080 --> 05:16.540
That way, you won't have to link with anyone.

05:21.300 --> 05:25.420
You fear contact with others' feelings, right?

05:25.420 --> 05:28.970
That's why you told Emiru awful things, so that she'd distance herself.

05:31.390 --> 05:33.350
Don't act so tough.

05:33.350 --> 05:37.560
You're the most despicable type of person when you're like that.

05:42.360 --> 05:45.070
It's just as you say.

05:45.400 --> 05:47.200
I <i>am</i> the most despicable person.

05:47.910 --> 05:49.910
I've been like that ever since I was a kid.

05:51.120 --> 05:56.210
But right now, there's someone I want my feelings to get through to!

05:56.580 --> 05:57.420
Let's go!

05:57.420 --> 05:58.080
Yeah.

06:22.230 --> 06:23.270
It can fly?

06:23.940 --> 06:28.070
Argent and Corpse are heading
toward the Lightless Realm's center.

06:28.780 --> 06:29.820
Should we pursue?

06:29.820 --> 06:32.620
It's too dangerous like this.

06:32.620 --> 06:35.950
We have the Argent's signal, so come back first.

06:35.950 --> 06:37.120
Roger that.

06:39.920 --> 06:40.750
Dammit!

06:45.840 --> 06:49.380
Everyone should die... Just die...

06:54.720 --> 06:55.640
Tsugumi...

06:56.350 --> 06:57.640
Wait!

07:04.940 --> 07:06.150
Tsugumi!

07:10.990 --> 07:13.200
You came for me after all.

07:16.540 --> 07:18.370
Resonance with Akashi was lost.

07:18.370 --> 07:21.830
But he's at the Lightless Realm's center now...

07:21.830 --> 07:24.210
He still has the Arbornine fruit.

07:24.210 --> 07:27.300
And if he can resonate with the Argent...

07:27.300 --> 07:29.170
You should be happy.

07:29.170 --> 07:32.510
The deity will punish every last person soon.

07:32.510 --> 07:34.720
Minashi, Sasame...

07:34.720 --> 07:36.350
They'll all be gone.

07:36.350 --> 07:38.770
Let's take our time and wait here.

07:38.770 --> 07:42.020
Is that what you're really wishing for?

07:42.940 --> 07:44.730
But of course.

07:44.730 --> 07:47.530
It's natural for sinners to be punished.

07:47.780 --> 07:51.700
If you're saying Sasame's a sinner, then I'm one too.

07:52.740 --> 07:54.160
Sasame again...

07:54.160 --> 07:58.450
All this time, she...

08:02.460 --> 08:06.380
Encroachment of the psyche, huh?

08:06.380 --> 08:07.840
Where is this?

08:07.840 --> 08:09.920
Someplace important to you?

08:13.130 --> 08:15.050
A memory you share with Sasame?

08:16.180 --> 08:17.010
Yeah.

08:17.510 --> 08:19.720
How am I different from her?

08:20.180 --> 08:25.600
We're twins, so our faces, shoulders, and even the shape of our ankles...

08:25.600 --> 08:27.690
Almost everything is the same!

08:28.480 --> 08:30.150
That's right...

08:30.150 --> 08:33.150
So it didn't have to be me at all.

08:33.610 --> 08:36.620
Giving out the deity's admonitions...

08:36.620 --> 08:39.030
Living alone with the Corpse...

08:39.620 --> 08:41.370
It could've been Sasame!

08:42.910 --> 08:48.710
But since she was younger and a good-for-nothing, I was forced to do it!

08:52.260 --> 08:58.100
The name Tsugumi is given to the one who shall become the main priestess.

08:56.640 --> 09:05.100
Toss a coconut onto the black of Corpses...

08:58.800 --> 09:00.470
Take note.

09:00.470 --> 09:05.140
Not one person can know about the Lightless Stone Deity.

09:05.100 --> 09:10.440
Suspicions of Charon and Garon...

09:05.140 --> 09:10.270
If someone finds out, you must seal their lips.

09:10.270 --> 09:11.780
All right?

09:11.780 --> 09:19.950
Crush the eyeballs and rip off the ears...

09:21.040 --> 09:28.210
Close it, shut it, yet truth of the heart...

09:28.210 --> 09:36.340
Reach the Corpse and echo around...

09:36.970 --> 09:41.140
I could have been the one at your side, Akashi...

09:41.810 --> 09:44.020
You're trapped within your past.

09:45.020 --> 09:46.480
The same goes for me though.

09:47.350 --> 09:49.810
I remembered the stuff from back when I was a kid.

09:50.480 --> 09:54.740
A different voice was hidden behind the adults' smiles.

09:55.780 --> 09:57.700
Sorry about your birthday.

09:57.700 --> 09:59.410
We have to go to work.

09:59.410 --> 10:01.740
Cry or smile at least.

10:01.740 --> 10:03.660
I'll make it up to you.

10:03.660 --> 10:05.830
I can't tell what he's thinking.

10:05.830 --> 10:06.910
What a creepy child.

10:07.210 --> 10:10.960
And that disgusted me, so I closed my heart off.

10:11.790 --> 10:16.470
I couldn't trust anyone, and I felt I didn't need anyone.

10:16.470 --> 10:21.180
But that's why I felt the warmth of touching someone from the heart.

10:21.760 --> 10:24.560
It was a heartwarming thing. Almost like a miracle.

10:26.890 --> 10:28.850
Like a miracle?

10:28.850 --> 10:30.100
That's right.

10:30.100 --> 10:32.980
You should be able to feel it too.

10:32.980 --> 10:36.440
So I want to understand your scars...

10:36.440 --> 10:38.320
I want to save you!

10:38.320 --> 10:40.110
You're saying the same thing.

10:42.620 --> 10:47.830
Minashi said everyone would be saved if we became one.

10:47.830 --> 10:52.460
I don't want to be with people who blame me, but...

10:52.840 --> 10:58.420
If I can atone for my sin that way and be with you...

11:00.340 --> 11:02.930
My sin?

11:07.770 --> 11:09.020
You'll catch a cold.

11:19.320 --> 11:20.530
It's beautiful.

11:20.530 --> 11:21.530
Yeah.

11:36.590 --> 11:37.590
That's not it...

11:38.550 --> 11:41.090
I wasn't the one who took you away.

11:41.930 --> 11:42.970
Tsugumi...

11:45.050 --> 11:51.520
It's just like Minashi said.
If everyone can become one, then that way...

11:51.520 --> 11:52.520
You're wrong.

11:52.520 --> 11:53.650
If we all become one...

11:57.940 --> 12:00.950
...who will be able to wipe the tears off your face?

12:02.820 --> 12:05.320
Tsugumi, let's go back together.

12:06.330 --> 12:08.990
No, I can't...

12:08.990 --> 12:09.950
Because...

12:10.500 --> 12:11.500
Stop it.

12:13.420 --> 12:16.040
Don't trouble Tsugumi any further.

12:17.000 --> 12:18.050
Minashi...

12:19.460 --> 12:22.010
Did you figure out Argent's current situation?

12:22.010 --> 12:22.760
No...

12:23.130 --> 12:27.640
Raika and the others don't feel anything, so I don't think he's in combat.

12:30.680 --> 12:32.060
The Arbornine fruit?

12:32.730 --> 12:35.600
I guess it's effective for about five hours.

12:35.600 --> 12:37.820
Is Akashi-kun all right?

12:37.820 --> 12:39.530
The time limit's close.

12:39.820 --> 12:43.030
Kasane, we're heading to the central area.

12:43.360 --> 12:45.660
Destination, 35139.

12:45.660 --> 12:47.950
The IX Amusement Park's Arbornine point.

12:47.950 --> 12:48.910
Got it.

12:48.910 --> 12:49.990
Be careful.

12:51.370 --> 12:53.080
All units, we're taking off!

12:54.160 --> 12:55.040
Roger that!

12:55.040 --> 12:56.580
This is it.

13:04.800 --> 13:08.470
Minashi, so you're all right—no, wait...

13:08.470 --> 13:10.010
Why are you here?

13:10.010 --> 13:12.730
Because Tsugumi accepted me.

13:13.520 --> 13:17.940
You really are a horrible person to bring her here.

13:18.230 --> 13:21.780
I came here to save Tsugumi.

13:21.780 --> 13:23.320
Don't lie!

13:23.940 --> 13:30.990
You see, Akashi and the others are trying to
get the Lightless Stone by killing the Corpse.

13:31.700 --> 13:33.330
What are you saying?

13:33.330 --> 13:36.370
We need it to save everyone.

13:36.370 --> 13:38.080
Horrible, isn't it?

13:38.080 --> 13:40.840
The Corpse was our friend.

13:40.840 --> 13:45.590
And the Corpse protected Tsugumi all this time in the Lightless Realm.

13:46.260 --> 13:48.390
There's nothing scary about it.

13:49.340 --> 13:50.550
That's right.

13:51.060 --> 13:53.100
There's absolutely nothing to fear.

14:02.940 --> 14:05.860
You're... infected with Necrometal.

14:06.780 --> 14:07.570
Yeah.

14:07.570 --> 14:09.490
I wished for it.

14:09.490 --> 14:11.370
Because it was necessary.

14:11.370 --> 14:13.490
Necessary?

14:13.490 --> 14:18.670
For hearts to become one,
everyone has to turn into Necrometal.

14:19.290 --> 14:23.460
Physical bodies, light, sound, places.

14:23.460 --> 14:26.340
Everything other than your heart loses meaning.

14:26.720 --> 14:30.180
Thanks to the deity, everyone will become happy.

14:30.890 --> 14:32.550
Are you sane?

14:32.550 --> 14:35.220
Even after you saw Emiru and Sasame suffer...

14:35.850 --> 14:39.560
If they accepted it and yielded, they wouldn't have.

14:39.560 --> 14:43.770
Even if our hearts did link, I'd never understand how you feel!

14:44.980 --> 14:46.240
So childish.

14:46.820 --> 14:50.820
I wanted you to understand our feelings.

14:50.820 --> 14:52.200
Hey, wait!

14:52.740 --> 14:53.950
Let's go, Tsugumi.

14:54.490 --> 14:57.830
You, Sasame, and I... we three can become one.

14:57.830 --> 14:59.670
I...

14:59.670 --> 15:01.000
I said to wait...

15:03.250 --> 15:07.300
We'll be reborn as one within the Corpse.

15:07.300 --> 15:14.000
And when you turn to Necrometal, you'll become one with us at some point since you can't escape.

15:15.260 --> 15:18.810
It's a shame we couldn't understand each other in the end.

15:20.730 --> 15:22.230
Minashi!

15:22.230 --> 15:23.730
Tsugumi!

15:25.400 --> 15:27.990
I have to get out of here right away.

15:28.820 --> 15:32.110
Someone resonate with me!

15:32.110 --> 15:32.700
Anyone!

15:34.870 --> 15:36.160
I don't care if it's Heito...

15:36.160 --> 15:36.660
Anyone...

15:36.660 --> 15:37.240
Iwato!

15:39.080 --> 15:39.790
Raika!

15:41.210 --> 15:42.290
Mahmu!

15:44.080 --> 15:45.540
I don't care who it is.

15:45.540 --> 15:47.920
Just get me out of here.

15:50.800 --> 15:52.010
Kasane-san...

15:52.010 --> 15:52.890
Suzaki-san...

15:54.720 --> 15:55.350
Emiru!

15:55.760 --> 15:56.720
Aoshi!

16:03.230 --> 16:03.900
Stop it!

16:04.770 --> 16:07.900
You're still trembling and closing off your heart.

16:08.610 --> 16:10.150
You really are a coward.

16:10.150 --> 16:11.700
Shut up!

16:11.700 --> 16:13.160
If I can get out of here...

16:13.160 --> 16:14.990
If I can fight again...

16:14.990 --> 16:17.120
I'll link myself to anyone!

16:17.740 --> 16:18.950
Reaper!

16:19.750 --> 16:22.460
No, Argent, answer me!

16:22.460 --> 16:23.750
Hey, Argent!

16:25.000 --> 16:26.590
Answer me!

16:30.630 --> 16:34.680
Argent, link with me!

16:39.310 --> 16:40.770
I'm back?

16:46.610 --> 16:48.230
This feeling...

16:49.070 --> 16:51.030
I'm one with the Argent.

16:52.360 --> 16:53.570
The Corpse...

16:53.570 --> 16:54.780
Where's Minashi?

16:55.320 --> 16:56.280
Akashi!

16:57.070 --> 17:01.040
How'd you escape from there without resonating with anyone?

17:01.870 --> 17:05.540
Can it be you're directly connected to the Reaper?

17:06.460 --> 17:10.960
You resonated with a plain old machine? You're amazing.

17:13.510 --> 17:15.880
Minashi, you and Sasame are...

17:21.890 --> 17:27.980
Sadly, the only way I could become one
with Gueules was to turn into Necrometal.

17:28.940 --> 17:31.690
Sasame was surprisingly unreasonable,

17:31.690 --> 17:34.990
so I'm having her take a nap now.

17:34.990 --> 17:36.660
What about the Corpse?

17:36.660 --> 17:39.160
It's already on the move.

17:39.160 --> 17:40.030
What?

17:40.030 --> 17:42.740
To have all become one.

17:42.740 --> 17:43.790
Where is it?

17:44.250 --> 17:47.750
The Corpse will become our body.

17:47.750 --> 17:49.750
I'm asking you where it is!

17:51.750 --> 17:54.550
If you want to know, you should link with me.

17:56.470 --> 17:58.050
I'll tell you.

17:58.050 --> 18:00.010
It's at the center of the Lightless Realm.

18:02.720 --> 18:04.020
Over there?

18:04.020 --> 18:06.390
Tsugumi, stand aside.

18:09.810 --> 18:12.940
Everything will end, and everything will begin.

18:12.940 --> 18:15.860
I'd like you to not interfere till then.

18:17.110 --> 18:18.070
Out of my way!

18:19.110 --> 18:20.870
I don't intend to fight you!

18:32.960 --> 18:33.800
What's wrong?

18:34.420 --> 18:36.010
Admonitions straight ahead.

18:36.010 --> 18:37.590
Shall we purge them?

18:37.590 --> 18:38.680
Hold on.

18:40.050 --> 18:41.550
They're acting strangely.

18:42.100 --> 18:44.640
It doesn't look like they'll be attacking either.

18:57.610 --> 18:58.610
Hey!

18:58.610 --> 18:59.530
I won't let you go!

18:59.990 --> 19:00.990
You won't get in our way!

19:11.380 --> 19:12.460
Let go of me!

19:12.460 --> 19:16.000
If you insist on inferring, then I have no choice!

19:42.070 --> 19:45.830
This body is Sasame's as well, you know.

19:45.830 --> 19:50.290
Sasame's wish is to stop you, no matter how it hurts!

19:50.290 --> 19:53.080
Enough of your assumptions!

19:53.080 --> 19:54.750
I'm not assuming!

19:54.750 --> 19:57.300
You being unable to resonate is proof alone!

19:57.300 --> 19:58.510
Shut up!

19:58.510 --> 20:01.340
Once we all become one, Sasame will understand too!

20:10.520 --> 20:13.520
The Reaper and Gueules are fighting each other...

20:13.520 --> 20:14.480
Why?

20:20.940 --> 20:22.110
Stop it already.

20:23.240 --> 20:24.660
You're right.

20:24.660 --> 20:26.240
It's almost time.

20:26.530 --> 20:27.530
What?

20:27.530 --> 20:28.790
Corpse!

20:28.790 --> 20:31.000
Take me and Akashi in!

20:58.480 --> 21:00.440
What is that?

21:00.440 --> 21:01.780
This is the Corpse.

21:02.360 --> 21:05.160
It's our new body from now on.

21:05.860 --> 21:07.910
Let's go, Akashi.

21:18.290 --> 21:21.380
What the hell is going on here?

21:22.050 --> 21:23.470
A human!

21:24.340 --> 21:25.680
Tsugumi-san!

21:25.680 --> 21:26.510
I'll protect you!

21:31.220 --> 21:32.810
Tsugumi-chan, hop on.

21:40.230 --> 21:42.900
It's the beginning of a world without corruption.

22:07.260 --> 22:08.840
They were swallowed whole...

22:08.840 --> 22:12.180
Hey, what's gonna happen to Akashi?

22:13.100 --> 22:14.640
This can't be...

22:15.230 --> 22:18.270
All signals from the Argent have been lost.

22:25.320 --> 22:26.650
Akashi...

22:56.470 --> 23:00.520
You lose your mind, you crash; a nervous breakdown

23:00.520 --> 23:05.280
You feel an urge inside, you crush; there's no escape now

23:05.280 --> 23:10.160
You try to change your life, you jump another let down

23:10.160 --> 23:12.740
But then you hear a voice inside

23:12.740 --> 23:16.040
You gotta open up your vision and see the life bestowed on you

23:16.040 --> 23:18.620
Blinded by reality

23:18.620 --> 23:20.790
Broken ideology

23:20.790 --> 23:23.340
Heart in captivity

23:23.340 --> 23:25.670
Hold on, exceeding the borders within

23:25.670 --> 23:28.170
Seize your capability

23:28.170 --> 23:30.550
Endless possibility

23:30.550 --> 23:32.890
Find your individuality

23:32.970 --> 23:35.100
Take pride; let the chase begin

23:35.100 --> 23:37.770
Don't tell me what direction you think I should take

23:37.770 --> 23:39.560
I know now to find the way

23:39.560 --> 23:42.560
Don’t tell me that this sable is for my own sake

23:42.560 --> 23:44.110
Here's what I’ve got to say

23:44.110 --> 23:47.360
Don't tell me to believe the decisions you make

23:47.360 --> 23:49.570
Facing a new day

23:49.570 --> 23:51.570
So open up your blinded eyes

23:51.570 --> 23:54.570
Stop living a lie and start living your life

23:54.570 --> 23:56.910
My way or no way

23:56.910 --> 23:59.370
Today you’re falling away

23:59.370 --> 24:01.710
My way or no way

24:01.710 --> 24:05.000
Today I’m breaking away

24:05.040 --> 24:10.050
Episode 24

24:05.040 --> 24:10.050
Original Sin, Past and Future
